msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Nintendo - NES / Famicom (FCEUmm)"
msgstr "Nintendo - NES / Famicom (FCEUmm)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "FCEUmm emulates NES, Famicom, and Famicom Disk System (FDS) platforms.[CR][CR]FCEUmm merges elements from FCEU Ultra, FCEU rerecording, FCEUXD, FCEUXDSP, FCEUXDSP CE, and FCEU-mm into a single branch of FCEU."
msgstr "FCEUmm emula le piattaforme NES, Famicom e Famicom Disk System (FDS).[CR][CR]FCEUmm unisce elementi di FCEU Ultra, FCEU rerecording, FCEUXD, FCEUXDSP, FCEUXDSP CE e FCEU-mm in un unico ramo di FCEU."

